    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I just want to Ask!&quot; is a medical registrar simulator with time management elements set in a provincial Russian hospital, featuring humorous elements. Your main task is to help patients, but each one has their own story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian flavor with familiar characters and references;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear gameplay. Your decisions will influence the storyline;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lunch break as the meaning of life.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: In this mode, you will immerse yourself in the stories of your patients and strive to become the best employee of the month, but at what cost?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode</strong>: This mode offers several work shifts, each with a set of tasks to complete during the shift. It is recommended to play this mode after completing the story mode to enjoy and relax after a real workday. It's relaxing and entertaining ;)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I just want to Ask!&quot; is a medical registrar simulator with time management elements set in a provincial Russian hospital, featuring humorous elements. Your main task is to help patients, but each one has their own story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian flavor with familiar characters and references;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear gameplay. Your decisions will influence the storyline;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lunch break as the meaning of life.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: In this mode, you will immerse yourself in the stories of your patients and strive to become the best employee of the month, but at what cost?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode</strong>: This mode offers several work shifts, each with a set of tasks to complete during the shift. It is recommended to play this mode after completing the story mode to enjoy and relax after a real workday. It's relaxing and entertaining ;)</p></li></ul>",
